<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Booking Cancellation</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333333; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px; }
    .header { border-bottom: 2px solid #717171; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .title { color: #717171; font-size: 24px; margin: 0; }
    .details-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; }
    .details-table td { padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee; }
    .details-table td.label { font-weight: bold; width: 40%; color: #555555; }
    .footer { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 12px; color: #888888; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; padding-top: 12px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1 class="title">Booking Cancelled</h1>
    </div>
    <p>Dear {{guestName}},</p>
    <p>Your reservation has been cancelled as requested.</p>
    
    <table class="details-table">
      <tr>
        <td class="label">Booking ID</td>
        <td>#{{bookingId}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="label">Property ID</td>
        <td>{{propertyId}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="label">Cancellation Status</td>
        <td>Cancelled</td>
      </tr>
      {{#if reason}}
      <tr>
        <td class="label">Reason</td>
        <td>{{reason}}</td>
      </tr>
      {{/if}}
    </table>

    <p>If this cancellation was made in error or you have billing inquiries, please reach out to customer support.</p>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated transactional message from Airbnb Clone. Please do not reply directly to this email.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
